        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:31.349Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This is why software services, like the autonomous recovery engine offered in NVIDIA Mission Control , are critical to scaling production AI.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/how-nvidia-mission-control-2-5-brings-autonomous-recovery-to-kubernetes/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:31.349Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As a part of Mission Control 2.5, this service is now extended to Kubernetes-based workloads managed using NVIDIA Run:ai .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/how-nvidia-mission-control-2-5-brings-autonomous-recovery-to-kubernetes/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:31.349Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The vision behind Mission Control’s autonomous recovery engine is simple: AI factories should be self-healing systems where failures are detected instantly, recovery decisions are made intelligently based on workload context and failure type, and jobs resume automatically with…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/how-nvidia-mission-control-2-5-brings-autonomous-recovery-to-kubernetes/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:31.349Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Because true self-governing resiliency is best understood as a control loop rather than a single recovery feature, the autonomous recovery engine then works with the workloads scheduler (HPC or Kubernetes) providing an integrated three-layer framework where each component play…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/how-nvidia-mission-control-2-5-brings-autonomous-recovery-to-kubernetes/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:31.349Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The three components of NVIDIA Mission Control 2.5’s autonomous recovery engine: the Kubernetes scheduler, the autonomous job recovery service, and the autonomous hardware recovery service",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/how-nvidia-mission-control-2-5-brings-autonomous-recovery-to-kubernetes/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z",
