      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The following scenarios show how the control loop behaves differently in Mission Control depending on the failure signal detected by its autonomous recovery engine.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/how-nvidia-mission-control-2-5-brings-autonomous-recovery-to-kubernetes/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z",
